    "number": "Theorem (lemma-log-B-regret-bound)",
    "quote": "We have: $R_B \\leq 2^6 \\lambda^2 \\cdot (\\sum_{k \\in \\{1, \\cdots, K \\} \\; | \\; \\Delta_k > 0} \\; \\frac{1}{ \\mu^c_k \\cdot \\Delta_k}) \\cdot \\ln(\\frac{B + 1}{ \\epsilon }) + O(1).$"
